    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Yuan-ti abominations have given up almost every trace of their humanity and look like huge, upright serpents with scaly arms and hands. In battle they love to crush enemies in their mighty coils or bite them with venomous fangs, and they can also turn into snakes that look no different from ordinary ones. Their true danger, however, lies in their cunning. These masterminds often head cult-like cells of other yuan-ti and steer them through elaborate plots, while staying out of harm’s way in hidden strongholds guarded by yuan-ti and serpents. These cold-blooded leaders understand the supernatural forces behind yuan-ti power better than anyone, and they usually keep treacherous magical traps and backup plans ready.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
